# Pocket Aquarium — repository ignore rules (PAIOS-03)
# The deployable game lives at the repository root; only the runtime app, valid
# assets, tests, docs, and the labs/reef-room export are tracked here.

# macOS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Node / build output — this project has no build step; guards accidental installs.
node_modules/
dist/

# The original nested reef prototype repo is NOT tracked here. Its tracked HEAD is
# exported to labs/reef-room as a distinct attribution commit (no .git/node_modules).
/reef/

# Preserved local checkpoints are development history, not part of the shipped app.
/checkpoints/

# Invalid RGB/checkerboard clownfish cutout — never ship as a sprite (v2 is valid).
/assets/animals/ocellaris-clownfish-v1.png

# Untracked reef orchestration artifact — never carried into this repo.
game_vertical_slice_repair_pack.md
